// github.com/docker/compose/v2 is compiled against the pre-split docker/cli,
// where command.Cli.Client() returns a github.com/docker/docker/client. From
// v29 onwards docker/cli returns a github.com/moby/moby/client instead, and
// compose does not build against it (no released compose does yet).
//
// Nothing keploy compiles needs v29: the requirement enters the graph only
// through github.com/cilium/ebpf's `tool` directive (crane ->
// go-containerregistry), which contributes no Go code to this binary. Pin to
// the version compose is built and tested against.
//
// Revisit when a compose release targets docker/cli v29.
replace github.com/docker/cli => github.com/docker/cli v28.5.1+incompatible
